Package: zcheck
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: filesystem integrity inventory checked against dpkg metadata
 zcheck records the files that should only change through packages or
 configuration management (type, mode, ownership, sha256, link targets),
 along with the owning dpkg package, whether each file still matches the
 checksum dpkg recorded at install, and every installed package's version.
 .
 `zcheck diff` compares two runs and separates package upgrades from
 unexplained changes; `zcheck audit` checks one run against package
 metadata. Runs are stored as one SQLite file each.
